Package: com.vcampro.bypass
Name: VCam Pro Bypass
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
Recommends: com.taokk3.qianmian
Description: VCam Pro runtime license bypass tweak. Zero modification of the vcam dylib: dyld add_image callback watches the vcam dylib load, immediately swaps LicenseCore/VCamCore methods, hooks gate2 + SecKeyVerifySignature + BWPhotoEncoder, plus ivar enforcement. No PAC/codesign risk, SpringBoard boots normally. Includes floating-ball control panel (volume-key entry): replace toggle, camera passthrough, pattern color, re-inject, log export.
